SUMMARY:[High] US CPI (Consumer Price Index)
DESCRIPTION:US Macro Data | Confirmed (official) | Source time: Wed 14-Oct-2026 08:30 EDT. Lean: Range-bound/quiet before\; sharp move at release. Direction set by surprise. Sentiment: Cautious - hot-print risk - Consensus: headline ~3.7% y/y (prior 3.4%)\, ~0.6% m/m\; core ~0.2% m/m\, ~2.5% y/y\; Cleveland Fed nowcast ~3.6%. Fed hiked to 3.75-4.00% on 16 Sep. A hot core (0.3%+) would revive hike pricing (BTC bear case ~$80K)\; a soft core supports a hold (bull case ~$87.5K retest). Sources: TradingKey\, Admiral\, FinanceFeeds\, Mitrade.
CATEGORIES:US Macro Data
